---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import directory from '../data/contributors.json';
import { allQuestions } from '../lib/catalog';
import { url, repoUrl } from '../lib/site';
const questions = await allQuestions();
const solutions = await getCollection('solutions');
const names = new Set<string>([...(directory as { username: string; role: string }[]).map(item => item.username), ...questions.flatMap(q => q.data.contributors), ...solutions.flatMap(s => s.data.contributors)]);
const contributors = [...names].sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b)).map(username => ({ username, role: (directory as { username: string; role: string }[]).find(item => item.username === username)?.role || 'Community contributor' }));
---
<Layout title="贡献者"><div class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE HANDBOOK</div><h1>知识因分享而生长。</h1><p class="page-description">感谢每一位提问、推导、验证和纠错的人。这里的每一次进步，都来自具体的贡献。</p><div class="section-heading"><h2>贡献者 <span class="inline-meta">{contributors.length}</span></h2><a class="text-link" href={repoUrl}>在 GitHub 查看贡献记录 ↗</a></div><div class="contributor-grid">{contributors.map(person => <a class="contributor-card" href={`https://github.com/${person.username}`}><img src={`https://github.com/${person.username}.png?size=128`} alt={`${person.username} 的 GitHub 头像`} width="64" height="64" loading="lazy"/><h3>@{person.username}</h3><p>{person.role}</p></a>)}<a class="contributor-card invitation" href={url('/contributing/')}><span class="invite-icon"><Icon name="people" size={26}/></span><h3>这里也可以有你</h3><p>提交你的第一份贡献 ↗</p></a></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>每一种贡献，都值得被记录。</h2><p>贡献不仅是完整解答：替代证明、Python 模拟、更清晰的解释、勘误、标签改进、页面优化和审阅，都能帮助后来者。</p><p>原作者无需独自承担长期维护。后续贡献者可以通过 Pull Request 改进内容，Git 历史保留作者与修订记录。</p><a class="button primary" href={url('/contributing/')}>阅读贡献指南 →</a></section></Layout>
